---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import LeadPopup from "../components/LeadPopup.astro";
import BackToTop from "../components/BackToTop.astro";

const description =
  "EliteFitness Is the oldest bodybuilding community forums in the world, started in 1996 it has grow to over 400,000 members. With topics like Anabolic steroids,Sarms,prohormones,TRT, hormone replacement and bodybuilding.";
const bodyClass = "home blog header-image full-width-content magazine-home";
---
<BaseLayout title="EliteFitness.com Bodybuilding and Steroids Mega community" description={description} bodyClass={bodyClass}>
  <Header />
  <div class="site-container">
    <div class="background-couple"></div>
    <div class="site-inner bgPattern">
      <div class="content-sidebar-wrap">
        <main class="content">



<div class="breadcrumbnew_and_tiitle">
  <h1 class="entry-title">Copyright and Intellectual Property Policy </h1>


<div class="mainadvertise wrapWhite mt40">
  <div class="advertiseContent">
    
	

	

  <p>
    Elite Fitness respects the intellectual property of others, and we ask our users to do the same. Elite Fitness has
    no responsibility for content on other websites that you may find or access when using Elite Fitness’s products or
    services. Material available on or through other websites may be protected by copyright and the intellectual
    property laws of the United States and/or other countries. The terms of use of those websites, and not the Elite
    Fitness Terms of Service, govern your use of that material.
  </p>
  <p>
    It is Elite Fitness’s policy, in appropriate circumstances and at its discretion, to disable and/or terminate the
    accounts of users who may infringe or repeatedly infringe the copyrights or other intellectual property rights of
    Elite Fitness and/or others.
  </p>
  <p>Notice for Claims of Intellectual Property Violations and Agent for Notice</p>
  <p>
    If you believe that your work has been copied in a way that constitutes copyright infringement, or that your
    intellectual property rights have been otherwise violated, please provide Elite Fitness's Agent for Notice with the
    following information (your "Notice"):
  </p>
  <ol>
    <li>
      an electronic or physical signature of the person authorized to act on behalf of the owner of the copyright or
      other intellectual property interest;
    </li>
    <li>a description of the copyrighted work or other intellectual property that you claim has been infringed;</li>
    <li>
      a description of where the material that you claim is infringing is located on the Elite Fitness site, with enough
      detail that we may find it on the website (in most circumstances, we will need a URL);
    </li>
    <li>your address, telephone number, and email address;</li>
    <li>
      a statement by you that you have a good faith belief that the disputed use is not authorized by the copyright or
      intellectual property owner, its agent, or the law;
    </li>
    <li>
      a statement by you, made under penalty of perjury, that the above information in your Notice is accurate and that
      you are the copyright or intellectual property owner or authorized to act on the copyright or intellectual
      property owner's behalf.
    </li>
  </ol>
  In some circumstances, in order to notify the subscriber, account holder or host who provided the allegedly infringing
  content to which Elite Fitness has disabled access, Elite Fitness may forward a copy of a valid Notice including name
  and email address to the subscriber or account holder, or may forward a copy of a valid Notice (with personally
  identifiable information removed) to Chilling Effects (<a href="http://www.chillingeffects.org" target="_blank"
    >http://www.chillingeffects.org</a
  >) for publication.<br />
  <p>
   <strong> Elite Fitness's Agent for Notice of claims of copyright or other intellectual property infringement can be reached
    as follows: </strong>
  </p>
  <p>
    <img src="https://www.elitefitness.com/copyright/ef-cr-img.jpg" align="left" alt="Contact" /><br />
  
</p>

	
	
	
	
	
	
	
	
  </div>
</div>











        </main>
      </div>
    </div>
    <Footer />
  </div>
  <BackToTop />
  <LeadPopup />
